  "name": "Scalekit",
  "abstract": "Authentication platform from the USA for B2B SaaS and AI agents. SaaSKit provides full-stack auth (hosted login with magic link/OTP, social login and passkeys, organizations, RBAC, sessions) with enterprise SSO (SAML/OIDC) and SCIM directory provisioning. Modular SSO and SCIM can also be added on top of an existing auth system. MCP Auth adds OAuth 2.1 authorization with dynamic client registration to MCP servers, and AgentKit handles delegated access for agents. The Free plan covers 25,000 MAUs, 25 organizations and one SSO and one SCIM connection. SaaS-only, with VPC and on-prem deployment on the Enterprise plan.",
